+ * VENUS (Xiaomi Mi 11, SM8350/lahaina): same DWC3 and QSCRATCH layout, but
+ * the GCC clock-gate offsets are lahaira's (Linux gcc-sm8350.c), not
+ * sdmmagpie's: 0x502c, 0x8201c and 0x6a004 are unmapped holes in lahaira's
+ * GCC aperture and reading one external-aborts (observed on hardware at
+ * _sweet_usb_probe+0x12c, the cfg-noc CBCR). Boot-arg venus=1 selects the
+ * lahaira offsets; the high-speed PHY also moved, to 0x088e3000, and is a
+ * different ("femto") PHY there, so it is not read.
  */
